    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's take a glinps of Shenzhen -- one of the biggest cities in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are generally two types of people in urban villages in Shenzhen: those who need to eat pig's trotter rice, and those who don't need to eat pig's trotter rice. But no matter what, there will always be a smell of pig's trotter rice in Shenzhen's urban villages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the same, it smells like pig's trotter rice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenants will check in randomly every day. Trade and upgrade your tenants to collect more rent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talents from various professions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who live in apartments come from all walks of life, and people from different walks of life have different characteristics, so take advantage of them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different personalities, different combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Golden Apartment, you can assign different personality tags to the tenants, and the personality tags will provide different benefits to the tenants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t be too sympathetic to your tenants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have no valuable tenants, sell them decisively!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's take a glinps of Shenzhen -- one of the biggest cities in China.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are generally two types of people in urban villages in Shenzhen: those who need to eat pig's trotter rice, and those who don't need to eat pig's trotter rice. But no matter what, there will always be a smell of pig's trotter rice in Shenzhen's urban villages. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is the same, it smells like pig's trotter rice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenants will check in randomly every day. Trade and upgrade your tenants to collect more rent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talents from various professions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People who live in apartments come from all walks of life, and people from different walks of life have different characteristics, so take advantage of them!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different personalities, different combinations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the Golden Apartment, you can assign different personality tags to the tenants, and the personality tags will provide different benefits to the tenants.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don\u2019t be too sympathetic to your tenants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have no valuable tenants, sell them decisively!</p>",
    "short_description": "Smart people go to college, and college graduates live in apartments. My cousin didn't go to college, but he had an apartment. I went to college, but I have not graduated, now I am helping my cousin. My cousin doesn\u2019t care who lives in the apartment, he cares about how much rent I receive.",
